  "hidden_text": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "In this survey, you’ll reflect on what makes a good lab partner and share your ideas about group collaboration, accountability, communication, and respect. Your responses will help shape a shared Lab Collaboration Contract that we’ll all sign next week. This contract will guide how we work together throughout the term. Please respond thoughtfully and honestly. There are no wrong answers!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Warning"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Move To... This element is a more accessible alternative to drag & drop reordering. Press Enter or Space to move this question. Question 1 0 / 1 pts Edit this Question Delete this Question 0 fill_in_multiple_blanks_question <p><strong>What qualities make someone a good lab partner?</strong></p> <p>List <strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"934\">three different qualities</strong> (traits, behaviors, or actions) that you believe make someone a good lab partner.</p> <table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 49.9457%;\">Quality 1:</td> <td style=\"width: 49.9457%;\"> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"width: 49.9457%;\">Quality 2:</td> <td style=\"width: 49.9457%;\"> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"width: 49.9457%;\">Quality 3:</td> <td style=\"width: 49.9457%;\"> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> What qualities make someone a good lab partner? List three different qualities (traits, behaviors, or actions) that you believe make someone a good lab partner. Quality 1: Quality 2: Quality 3: Answer 1: reliable Answer 2: clear Answer 3: patient"
    },
