    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Move To... This element is a more accessible alternative to drag & drop reordering. Press Enter or Space to move this question. Question 2 Not yet graded / 1 pts Edit this Question Delete this Question 0 essay_question <strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1053\">Reflecting on collaboration:</strong><br data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1056\">Describe <strong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1102\">one example of good collaboration</strong> in a group setting. This could be something you’ve experienced, something you’d like to see, or something you think all lab groups should aim for. Reflecting on collaboration:Describe one example of good collaboration in a group setting. This could be something you’ve experienced, something you’d like to see, or something you think all lab groups should aim for. Your Answer: One example of good collaboration is when group members divide the work fairly, communicate about their progress, and help each other understand the lab instead of only focusing on finishing quickly. A good lab group should make sure everyone has a chance to contribute and that the final work represents shared understanding."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Move To..."
