    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Move To... This element is a more accessible alternative to drag & drop reordering. Press Enter or Space to move this question. Question 4 Not yet graded / 1 pts Edit this Question Delete this Question 0 essay_question <strong data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1501\">Reflecting on communication:</strong><br data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1504\">What’s one <strong data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1538\">communication habit</strong> that’s important in a group setting, especially in an online course? You might think about texting, emailing, giving feedback, or responding to messages. Reflecting on communication:What’s one communication habit that’s important in a group setting, especially in an online course? You might think about texting, emailing, giving feedback, or responding to messages. Your Answer: One important communication habit is responding to group messages in a reasonable amount of time, especially in an online course. Even a short reply helps the group know that everyone is aware of the plan and prevents confusion about meetings, deadlines, or assigned tasks."
    },
