    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Move To... This element is a more accessible alternative to drag & drop reordering. Press Enter or Space to move this question. Question 5 Not yet graded / 1 pts Edit this Question Delete this Question 0 essay_question <strong data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1723\">Reflecting on respect:</strong><br data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1726\">How can lab partners <strong data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1763\">show respect</strong> to each other during collaboration? Share a specific behavior or mindset that helps create a respectful group environment. Reflecting on respect:How can lab partners show respect to each other during collaboration? Share a specific behavior or mindset that helps create a respectful group environment. Your Answer: Lab partners can show respect by listening to each other’s ideas, being patient when someone asks questions, and giving feedback in a constructive way. A respectful group environment is one where people feel comfortable contributing without worrying that their ideas will be dismissed."
    },
