      "index": 34,
      "text": "Move To... This element is a more accessible alternative to drag & drop reordering. Press Enter or Space to move this question. Question 6 Not yet graded / 1 pts Edit this Question Delete this Question 0 essay_question <strong data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1934\">Is there anything else you want to add?</strong> (Optional)<br data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1950\">Use this space to share anything else you think should be included in the Lab Collaboration Contract or anything we may have missed. Is there anything else you want to add? (Optional)Use this space to share anything else you think should be included in the Lab Collaboration Contract or anything we may have missed. Your Answer: I think the Lab Collaboration Contract should include expectations for communication, fair division of work, meeting attendance, and what to do if someone is unable to complete their part. Having clear expectations early can help prevent misunderstandings later."
